NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the tooling, schema, catalog and metadata in this
repository. It does NOT cover the .glb models under models/, each of which
carries its own licence in its entries/<sprite_id>.json file and in
index.json. Check a model's own entry before reusing it.

No Project Zomboid art is contained in this repository. Models reference PZ
sprites by name and are textured at runtime from the user's own copy of the
game. Project Zomboid is the property of The Indie Stone.
